<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C, Pass 24 — Wyyyschokk creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Wyyyschokk` ThingDef/
  PawnKindDef pair, renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. New `RSW_Wyyyschokk`
  BodyDef (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml) — vanilla Shell/InsectHeart/Pronotum/
  InsectHead/InsectMouth/Arm/InsectLeg parts plus the already-ported
  `RSW_SWLeftLegClawAttackTool`/`RSW_SWRightLegClawAttackTool` groups (Wave B)
  — no new part/group defs. `leatherDef` (`Leather_Insectile`) ALREADY
  EXISTS as `RSW_Leather_Insectile` (Wave B). New `RSW_WoolWyyyschokk`
  (donor-custom shearable wool, texPath swresource/Leather_Wool/Leather_Wool,
  an already-extracted shared texture). `useMeatFrom>Megaspider` stays
  bare (vanilla Core meat-appearance reuse, not a specificMeatDef). Ability:
  `SW_WebShot` (specialTrainables + PawnKindDef abilities) ALREADY EXISTS as
  `RSW_SW_WebShot` (a FOUR-def group — AbilityDef/HediffDef `RSW_SW_Webbed`/
  TrainableDef/projectile `RSW_SW_WebShotprojectile`, RSW_MlieWaveC_Abilities.xml,
  first consumed by Kinrath) — wired here as its second consumer. New
  `RSW_EggWyyyschokkFertilized`/`UnFertilized` eggs (texPath swresource/EggSilk,
  2 PNGs newly extracted this pass — no prior species used this egg color).
  All 4 vocal sounds already absorbed (`RSW_Pawn_Wyyyschokk_*`).

  `mandrake.rsw.wyyyschokkartoverride` ships owner-approved art at the SAME
  relative texPath the donor uses (swanimals/Wyyyschokk/Wyyyschokk_{south,
  east,north}) — per the Anooba incident (5a8fc8c1c) precedent, did NOT
  extract or ship those 3 facings, only `Wyyyschokk_Dessicated` (1 PNG, the
  one facing the override doesn't cover).
-->
